# Testing Rules

## Required for feature Done

- Unit tests for pure domain (policies, pricing, idempotency)
- Authz positive + negative tests for sensitive endpoints
- Integration tests for payment webhook & reward SSV handlers when touched
- No critical path without error handling tests

## Security tests

Replay webhook · replay reward tx · unauthorized playback URL · teacher isolation

## Do not merge if

Build fails · tests fail · secrets present · Core duplication introduced
